2. Snowflake Cortex Agent Evaluation
========================================================

Summary:
Designed and implemented the CI/CD setup, evaluation dataset, evaluation scripts, and quality gates for the Snowflake Cortex agent. Work included building the dataset of test cases against expected outcomes, scripting the evaluation runs, integrating the evaluation into the CI/CD pipeline as an automated gate, and surfacing results to the team for review.

Benefit / Client impact:
- Enabled automated, repeatable quality assessment of the Cortex agent on every change, replacing manual ad-hoc testing.
- Provided objective metrics for agent quality, giving the team a baseline to measure regressions and improvements against.
- Reduced risk of releasing agent changes that degrade behavior, by gating deployments on evaluation results.
- Faster iteration on agent improvements, since the evaluation feedback loop is now automated.

