3. Terraform Plugin Crash Resolution
========================================================

Summary:
Investigated and resolved a recurring crash in the Terraform plugin that was blocking infrastructure changes. Identified the root cause, applied the fix, and verified stable operation across subsequent runs.

Benefit / Client impact:
- Unblocked infrastructure deployments that were previously failing due to the plugin crash.
- Restored reliability of the Terraform-based provisioning workflow for the team.
- Avoided manual workarounds and reduced operational toil for engineers running Terraform plans/applies.
